ned, and a thin line of dust appeared in the south. The men packed quickly, checked the ropes, and set off again at a steady walk. As the light failed, the guide pointed toward a dark shape against the sky and told them that the ruins of the old fort were less than an hour away. The boy remembered the phrase his grandmother had taught him, the one she used whenever the road grew hard: إِنَّ الصَّبْرَ مِفْتَاحُ الفَرَجِ. He whispered it to himself, and the words seemed to settle something in his chest. When they reached the fort, the gates were gone and the walls were half fallen, but there was a well in the courtyard and the water was cold and clean. The men drank, fed the camels, and lay down under the stars. Before sleep the guide spoke for the first time about the next stage of the journey, the long empty stretch where there was no water at all, and the boy listened without fear, repeating the phrase once more under his breath as the fire burned down.","passed":true,"expected_active":true,"activation":1.75196,"expected_delta":null,"observed_delta":null,"detail":"Long-context probe with the split Arabic bytes buried deep inside a passage well over 512 tokens, testing whether the claimed mechanism survives distant context.","measured":true},{"kind":"counterfactual","prompt":"قال إن الكتاب جديد. -> قال إن ال كتاب جديد.","passed":true,"expected_active":null,"activation":null,"expected_delta":0.46,"observed_delta":0.456179,"detail":"","measured":true},{"kind":"counterfactual","prompt":"قال إن الكتاب جديد. -> قال إن المدرسة جديدة.","passed":true,"expected_active":null,"activation":null,"expected_delta":0.46,"observed_delta":0.456179,"detail":"","measured":true},{"kind":"counterfactual","prompt":"An arithmetical problem appeared. -> An arith met ical problem appeared.","passed":true,"expected_active":null,"activation":null,"expected_delta":0.39,"observed_delta":0.387006,"detail":"","measured":true},{"kind":"counterfactual","prompt":"Η ζωή είναι ωραία. -> Жизнь прекрасна